ians and the israelis  it's important for the entire region and  the world  we appreciate your support for the  continuation of the negotiations and we  will  exert every effort possible to make sure  that they will succeed and to take  advantage of this historical opportunity  we understand there will be difficulties  that will do  thank you everybody
 

